623	638SEDZ8	\N	Lexical variation and change: Integrating lexis into variationist sociolinguistics	{"key": "638SEDZ8", "data": {"DOI": "10.1017/S0954394525100628", "key": "638SEDZ8", "url": "https://www.cambridge.org/core/product/2A0FA31822482F245565BA808BF7E2A2", "ISSN": "0954-3945", "PMID": "", "date": "2025", "tags": [{"tag": "language change", "type": 1}, {"tag": "lexical variation", "type": 1}, {"tag": "signs", "type": 1}, {"tag": "sociolinguistic theory", "type": 1}, {"tag": "variationist sociolinguistics", "type": 1}, {"tag": "words", "type": 1}], "PMCID": "", "extra": "", "issue": "3", "pages": "293-318", "place": "", "title": "Lexical variation and change: Integrating lexis into variationist sociolinguistics", "rights": "", "series": "", "volume": "37", "archive": "Cambridge Core", "section": "", "version": 1840, "creators": [{"lastName": "Sandow", "firstName": "Rhys", "creatorType": "author"}, {"lastName": "Grieve", "firstName": "Jack", "creatorType": "author"}, {"lastName": "Stamp", "firstName": "Rose", "creatorType": "author"}, {"lastName": "Schembri", "firstName": "Adam", "creatorType": "author"}], "itemType": "journalArticle", "language": "", "dateAdded": "2026-03-31T13:50:10Z", "partTitle": "", "publisher": "", "relations": {}, "accessDate": "", "callNumber": "", "partNumber": "", "seriesText": "", "shortTitle": "", "citationKey": "", "collections": ["SJV4SW6W"], "seriesTitle": "", "abstractNote": "In this paper, we advocate for the analysis of lexical variation being central to variationist sociolinguistics. We demonstrate that lexical variation is systematic and argue that this systematicity must be accounted for by a comprehensive variationist theory that explains the general causes and mechanisms of language variation and change. We present three empirical studies, which focus on lexical variation in Anglo-Cornish, British Sign Language, and online American English. These studies differ greatly in terms of their methods and results, but each reaffirms that lexis can be studied rigorously and informatively within the variationist paradigm, extending our understanding of language variation and change.", "dateModified": "2026-03-31T13:50:10Z", "libraryCatalog": "Cambridge University Press", "archiveLocation": "", "publicationTitle": "Language Variation and Change", "journalAbbreviation": ""}, "meta": {"parsedDate": "2025", "numChildren": 0, "createdByUser": {"id": 7831302, "name": "", "links": {"alternate": {"href": "https://www.zotero.org/lumpazi", "type": "text/html"}}, "username": "Lumpazi"}, "creatorSummary": "Sandow et al."}, "links": {"self": {"href": "https://api.zotero.org/groups/5540614/items/638SEDZ8", "type": "application/json"}, "alternate": {"href": "https://www.zotero.org/groups/lexat_sprachplattform/items/638SEDZ8", "type": "text/html"}}, "library": {"id": 5540614, "name": "LexAT_Sprachplattform", "type": "group", "links": {"alternate": {"href": "https://www.zotero.org/groups/lexat_sprachplattform", "type": "text/html"}}}, "version": 1840}
634	R6WJKWC6	\N	International standards for the identification and the description of languages and their varieties	{"key": "R6WJKWC6", "data": {"DOI": "10.1515/9783112208212-003", "key": "R6WJKWC6", "url": "", "ISBN": "978-3-11-914802-3", "ISSN": "", "date": "2025", "tags": [{"tag": "Computer science", "type": 1}], "extra": "", "pages": "35-60", "place": "Berlin", "title": "International standards for the identification and the description of languages and their varieties", "format": "", "rights": "", "series": "Digital Humanities", "volume": "", "archive": "", "edition": "", "version": 1782, "creators": [{"lastName": "Romary", "firstName": "Laurent", "creatorType": "author"}], "itemType": "bookSection", "language": "", "bookTitle": "Harmonizing language data Standards for linguistic resources", "dateAdded": "2026-01-28T11:52:52Z", "publisher": "de Gruyter", "relations": {}, "accessDate": "", "callNumber": "", "shortTitle": "", "citationKey": "", "collections": ["SJV4SW6W"], "abstractNote": "", "dateModified": "2026-01-28T11:55:42Z", "originalDate": "", "seriesNumber": "4", "originalPlace": "", "libraryCatalog": "", "archiveLocation": "", "numberOfVolumes": "", "originalPublisher": ""}, "meta": {"parsedDate": "2025", "numChildren": 1, "createdByUser": {"id": 7831302, "name": "", "links": {"alternate": {"href": "https://www.zotero.org/lumpazi", "type": "text/html"}}, "username": "Lumpazi"}, "creatorSummary": "Romary", "lastModifiedByUser": {"id": 5971734, "name": "", "links": {"alternate": {"href": "https://www.zotero.org/anjaw71", "type": "text/html"}}, "username": "anjaw71"}}, "links": {"self": {"href": "https://api.zotero.org/groups/5540614/items/R6WJKWC6", "type": "application/json"}, "alternate": {"href": "https://www.zotero.org/groups/lexat_sprachplattform/items/R6WJKWC6", "type": "text/html"}}, "library": {"id": 5540614, "name": "LexAT_Sprachplattform", "type": "group", "links": {"alternate": {"href": "https://www.zotero.org/groups/lexat_sprachplattform", "type": "text/html"}}}, "version": 1782}
635	BPSRP2DP	\N	Lexik aus areal-horizontaler und vertikal-sozialer Perspektive – Erhebungsmethoden zur inter- und intraindividuellen Variation	{"key": "BPSRP2DP", "data": {"DOI": "", "key": "BPSRP2DP", "url": "", "ISSN": "", "PMID": "", "date": "2021", "tags": [], "PMCID": "", "extra": "", "issue": "4", "pages": "387-431", "place": "", "title": "Lexik aus areal-horizontaler und vertikal-sozialer Perspektive – Erhebungsmethoden zur inter- und intraindividuellen Variation", "rights": "", "series": "", "volume": "46", "archive": "", "section": "", "version": 1767, "creators": [{"lastName": "Lenz", "firstName": "Alexandra N.", "creatorType": "author"}, {"lastName": "Dorn", "firstName": "Amelie", "creatorType": "author"}, {"lastName": "Ziegler", "firstName": "Theresa", "creatorType": "author"}], "itemType": "journalArticle", "language": "", "dateAdded": "2026-01-28T11:37:30Z", "partTitle": "", "publisher": "", "relations": {}, "accessDate": "", "callNumber": "", "partNumber": "", "seriesText": "", "shortTitle": "", "citationKey": "", "collections": ["SJV4SW6W"], "seriesTitle": "", "abstractNote": "Zusammenfassung: Obwohl die Erhebung und Dokumentation von ‚Spezialwortschätzen‘ nach wie vor einen Schwerpunkt der Dialektologie darstellt, zählt die lexikalische Variation innerhalb der modernen variationslinguistischen Forschung zu den (eher) vernachlässigten Systemebenen. Insbesondere die vertikal-soziale Variation von Lexik auf der gesamten Dialekt- Standard-Achse stellt ein Forschungsdesiderat dar. Diese Forschungslücke wundert auch, weil lexikalische Varianten aus der Perspektive der Sprechenden wohl zu den salientesten Phänomenen zählen. In diesem Beitrag stellen wir eine Studie zur lexikalischen Variation vor, die das skizzierte Desideratum angeht, indem sie explizit die inter- und intraindividuelle Variation entlang der gesamten Dialekt-Standard-Achse fokussiert. Hauptziel der Fragebogenerhebung war es, Daten zur lexikalischen Variation der deutschen Sprache in Österreich zu erheben, die Aussagen zur areal-horizontalen und vertikal-sozialen Dimension lexikalischer Variation ermöglichen. \\n\\nAbstract: Lexical variation counts up to date as one of the largely neglected system levels of modern variationist linguistic research on German. In particular vertical-social variation on the dialect/standard axis has only been investigated sparingly in previous lexical studies and projects, something that is rather surprising given that investigations on lexical phenomena (‘special words’) have been a prominent focus in traditional dialectology and also count as one of the most interesting system levels from the speakers’ perspective. In this paper we present an investigation on lexical phenomena conducted by means of a nation-wide questionnaire, taking into account inter- and intra-individual variation. The main aim of the questionnaire survey was to collect data on the lexical variation of the German language in Austria, which enables statements to be made about the areal-horizontal and vertical-social dimension of lexical variation.", "dateModified": "2026-01-28T11:37:30Z", "libraryCatalog": "", "archiveLocation": "", "publicationTitle": "Sprachwissenschaft", "journalAbbreviation": "Sprachwissenschaft"}, "meta": {"parsedDate": "2021", "numChildren": 0, "createdByUser": {"id": 7831302, "name": "", "links": {"alternate": {"href": "https://www.zotero.org/lumpazi", "type": "text/html"}}, "username": "Lumpazi"}, "creatorSummary": "Lenz et al."}, "links": {"self": {"href": "https://api.zotero.org/groups/5540614/items/BPSRP2DP", "type": "application/json"}, "alternate": {"href": "https://www.zotero.org/groups/lexat_sprachplattform/items/BPSRP2DP", "type": "text/html"}}, "library": {"id": 5540614, "name": "LexAT_Sprachplattform", "type": "group", "links": {"alternate": {"href": "https://www.zotero.org/groups/lexat_sprachplattform", "type": "text/html"}}}, "version": 1767}
